1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,381
See where the month went, then take a clear report with you.

2
00:00:04,253 --> 00:00:14,239
Open Reports and select the month you need. The period follows your workspace time zone. Only completed time entries contribute to the final totals.

3
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:26,003
An administrator can view the whole team or select individual members. Check the completed time, the project breakdown and each person’s contribution before exporting.

4
00:00:27,053 --> 00:00:36,902
Shared notes and approved monthly summaries add context to the report. Private notes and unapproved drafts are kept out of the team’s shared work summary.

5
00:00:37,953 --> 00:00:51,499
Download a PDF for reading, a CSV for analysis, or a ZIP archive. Collective exports require an administrator. Finish any active timers and clear pending synchronisation first.

6
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:56,472
A clear monthly view, ready to read, share or analyse.
